<item>
            <title>[LU-20676]  Set the qstr hash with full_name_hash() in ll_iget_for_nfs()</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20676</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;QSTR_INIT() leaves &quot;.lustre&quot; and &quot;fid&quot; hashes at 0 in ll_iget_for_nfs(), so that d_lookup() never hits the VFS dentry. We should set the qstr hash with full_name_hash() to fix that.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
